{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Metrogether</strong> is a train simulator where you drive, collect passengers, work together with friends and explore the subway network in a fictional city. Embark on your journey as a train driver or ticket inspector in single and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a subway train, try to follow the timetable and collect passengers as you travel from station to station in this immersive subway simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Driving_Trains.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Subway Network</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in this fictional subway network, filled with tunnels, bustling stations, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Explore.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as a Ticket Inspector</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a vigilant ticket inspector, ensuring that passengers have valid tickets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Play_as_a_Ticket_Inspector.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play together with your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with friends or strangers to explore the subway network together. You can team up with one player driving and another checking tickets, or take on different journeys in the same world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Play_with_your_friends.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Train Simulation:</strong>\u00a0Drive trains with realistic physics, obey speed limits, stop at stations and signals, collect passengers and check tickets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open World:</strong> Explore the Open World by train or on foot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No fail screens:</strong> There are no fail screens, even when you run a stop signal or cause an accident.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Play in Multiplayer with lots of other players simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Selection:</strong>\u00a0Choose from a variety of characters. Try roleplaying to fit in or pick something out of the ordinary; the choice is yours.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3239770?t=1745244758","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745244758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/8cd1bbff795478ae172245a223a1d9daaa9498f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745244758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/8cd1bbff795478ae172245a223a1d9daaa9498f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745244758","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Metrogether</strong> is a train simulator where you drive, collect passengers, work together with friends and explore the subway network in a fictional city. Embark on your journey as a train driver or ticket inspector in single and multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a subway train, try to follow the timetable and collect passengers as you travel from station to station in this immersive subway simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Driving_Trains.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Subway Network</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in this fictional subway network, filled with tunnels, bustling stations, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Explore.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as a Ticket Inspector</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a vigilant ticket inspector, ensuring that passengers have valid tickets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Play_as_a_Ticket_Inspector.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play together with your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join forces with friends or strangers to explore the subway network together. You can team up with one player driving and another checking tickets, or take on different journeys in the same world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/extras/Play_with_your_friends.gif?t=1745244758\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Train Simulation:</strong>\u00a0Drive trains with realistic physics, obey speed limits, stop at stations and signals, collect passengers and check tickets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open World:</strong> Explore the Open World by train or on foot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No fail screens:</strong> There are no fail screens, even when you run a stop signal or cause an accident.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Play in Multiplayer with lots of other players simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Selection:</strong>\u00a0Choose from a variety of characters. Try roleplaying to fit in or pick something out of the ordinary; the choice is yours.</p></li></ul>","developers":["camelCase Games"],"dlc":[3644650],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239770/header.jpg?t=1745244758","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124605,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124605/movie480.mp4?t=1744316828","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124605/movie_max.mp4?t=1744316828"},"name":"Metrogether Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124605/3ef16d2a4428d3278a2cd833b1fcbc7a138d1b93/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744316828","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124605/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744316828","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124605/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744316828"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257112962,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112962/movie480.mp4?t=1744316258","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112962/movie_max.mp4?t=1744316258"},"name":"Rolling Stock Trailer",